            "text": "fan stitch"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " baby blanket is 75 x 90 cm. Seven trebles spread into one stitch make a wide fan, then a dc sits between each fan. The fans stack vertically on each other across every row."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "DK cotton in a pale colour shows the fan spread clearly. The fans are wider than a standard shell, making them easier to see and count. Total yardage is around 310 g."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
